OL,3,AAnthropic heads for lower than expected
OL,4,A$1.3 trillion valuation in stock market
OL,5,Adebut
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is floating at a volatile time for
OL,8,FAI firms. After last week's US midterm
OL,9,Felections, the Nasdaq fell sharply on
OL,10,Fconcerns a Democrat-led Congress could
OL,11,Fslow development of AI and the buildout
OL,12,Fof data centres.
